      <activity id="13dcd3e6-b983-52b9-9e42-efd9e9049bce" activityNameId="305f8130-e347-56de-b169-c8bd004e3156" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Molybdenite, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Molybdenite, at plant
The module describes the production mix composed of molybdenite from coupled production in copper industry and molybdenite as main product. It is designed for the use in Ecoinvent as starting material for the manufacturing of molybdenum trioxide and ferromolybdenum, both materials which used in the manufacturing of high quality steels and alloys.;
CAS number: 001309-56-4; 
UUID: 8032afd9-e344-3cb5-af44-4452b59f3035
All relevant processes in mining, beneficiation, metallurgy and disposal of the tailings are included.
Location: undefined
Technology: This production mix is fully based on the related exploitation of copper ore.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 130000 t Mo in Molybdenite
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8032afd9-e344-3cb5-af44-4452b59f3035.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
